      "process_md": "***Interested and eligible students need to apply online on the*** [***Atma Nirbhar Yojana***](https://agri.arunachal.gov.in/atmanirbhar_yojana/) ***portal.*** \n**New User Registration**\n\n   1. Select the &amp;quot;[Login](https://agri.arunachal.gov.in/atmanirbhar_yojana/login)&amp;quot; option.   1. Subsequently, click on the &amp;quot;[Register Here&amp;quot;](https://agri.arunachal.gov.in/atmanirbhar_yojana/user-register) link.   1. Complete the registration form with the requisite details, including your name, Aadhaar card number, email ID, and mobile number.\n   1. Establish a password for your account.\n   1. Upon successful registration, the applicant will receive a User ID and password.\n\n***Login &amp;amp; Application Process:***\n\n   1. [Log in](https://agri.arunachal.gov.in/atmanirbhar_yojana/login) using the provided User ID and password to access the application form.   1. Fill in the complete application form.\n   1. Upload the required documents, including a photograph, caste certificate, residential certificate, and land ownership proof, etc.\n   1. Submit the application form. \n\n"
